  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "If the VRC Team truly cares about the wonderful raving/music/event scene in VRC then more needs to be done in regards to HARDWARE-BOUND ACCESSIBILITY. Both users on high end and low end hardware would enjoy better ways to tweak performance. The latter (like myself) absolutely feel the need to have them. Having the ABILITY to TOGGLE OFF elements such as MIRRORS, DYNAMIC  SHADOWS (maybe lights) and POST PROCESSING would have a meaningful impact whenever the player's hardware hits its limits and needs whatever bit of help. It would be especially amazing if we could decide to HIDE AVATARS/PLAYERS  completely as not to load any data about them except their rough position in the world, possibly depending on range and excluding friends.",
